commit.message:
feat(pd): grants error;

- Changed the error and validation messages for agreement value.
- Updated pytest.

fix(i18n): pd missing activity translations, pd datatables binding;

- Added solution for CKAN JS i18n listening.
- Added missing french translations for all pd types for the activity metadata.

fix(templates): panel headings, modals;

- Fixed z-index for modals.
- Improved panel heading layouts.

